// The charms a Pokédex filled earns (plan 40 · GE5, decision 3; Models/Charms.cs; docs/data-files.md, "Charms"). Ours:
// the later games give each charm for a Pokédex of their own, and here any region's designer hands over what is due.
// "regional" is the order the regional Pokédexes seen whole earn them, whichever regions they are: the first completed
